      "rationale": "A nullable element slot is spelled `Array[uint?]`, which the language gives no typed container: it reports `is_typed() == false`, so the element store admits anything. These cells expect the check the law requires and fail against it, which is how https://github.com/cafecito-games/Foundry/issues/2515 is represented rather than deleted."
